
# Mice With Grappling Hooks

This is a 2D game where you can fly around as a mouse using a grappling hook.


# Installing

To install MWGH, go to the releases page


# Compiling

To compile MWGH, you need to install the following:
- gcc
- libsdl2

Note for Windows users, you also need to install Msys2. The above list of software needs to be installed inside Msys2.
